</a>


<div class="provider-hero">
  <h1 class="provider-title">Attested Memory</h1>
  <p class="provider-desc">Attested Memory provides verifiable context for people, teams, and autonomous agents through a SaaS platform that stores durable knowledge with cryptographic identity, truth state, and provenance. It offers personal, team, and expert memory products, USDC‑settled transactions, escrow, metering, and proof capabilities, all federated via the KOVA hub and integrated with the open AIMarket ecosystem.</p>
  <div class="provider-overview"><p>Attested Memory publishes 56 API contracts indexed on the <a href="https://apis.io/">APIs.io</a> network, including A2a API, Accounts API, Acex Capital API, and 53 more. Tagged areas include Company, Software-as-a-Service, Verifiable Memory, AI Agents, and USDC.</p>

<p>The Attested Memory catalog on APIs.io includes 1 JSON-LD context and 1 Spectral governance ruleset.</p>

<p>Attested Memory’s developer surface includes documentation, getting-started guide, and 15 more developer resources.</p>
</div>

  
  <div class="provider-links">
    <a class="provider-link" href="https://attestedmemory.net/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">&#127760; Visit website</a><a class="provider-link secondary" href="https://github.com/api-evangelist/attestedmemory-net" target="_blank" rel="noopener" title="API Evangelist's profile repository for this provider — the data behind this page, not the provider's own source code">&#128225; Profile data on GitHub</a></div>
  
