<!-- Resources Section — grouped by the JOB the resource does, mirroring the way
     the rating panel groups its checks into facets. A provider can declare 50+
     properties; ungrouped they were an undifferentiated wall of cards where a
     status page sat next to a privacy policy. The groups follow the integrator's
     arc: start it, read it, build it, secure it, learn it, run it, then the
     commercial and corporate surface.

     Each property's `group` is assigned in build.py (resource_group()), so this
     template only has to filter — Liquid has no array-append, which makes the
     equivalent in-template grouping quadratic and fragile. -->

